ne":142,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a dark shaded button for watchOS on a black background, that includes the Apple logo and text that reads 'Sign in'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/dbd9944a0b54c61b4ad31ae7a1ba5a82/apple-account-watch-44mm%402x.png","line":146,"embedded":true},{"title":"Button size and corner radius","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sign-in-with-apple#Button-size-and-corner-radius","line":148},{"title":"`cornerRadius`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AuthenticationServices/ASAuthorizationAppleIDButton/cornerRadius","line":150},{"title":"Displaying Sign in with Apple buttons on the web","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/signinwithapple/displaying-sign-in-with-apple-buttons-on-the-web","line":150},{"title":"An illustration of a 'Sign in with Apple' button with 90-degree corners.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4f279ff515dfcb50faf6f085acceffb9/apple-account-minimum-corner-radii%402x.png","line":152,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a 'Sign in with Apple' button with the default corner radius.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7510291ce4d0cd5b91bd325078a054e9/apple-account-default-corner-radii%402x.png","line":154,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a 'Sign in with Apple' button with the maximum corner radius, which results in a capsule-like appearance.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/baeeaf354ab05437b35812f154e33497/apple-account-maximum-corner-radii%402x.png","line":156,"embedded":true},{"title":"Creating a custom Sign in with Apple button","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sign-in-with-apple#Creating-a-custom-Sign-in-with-Apple-button","line":164},{"title":"An illustration that includes two side-by-side partial iPhones showing sign-in screens. The screen on the left includes four stacked buttons: Sign in with Apple, Sign in with X, Sign in with Y, and Sign in with Z. The Sign in with Apple button includes an Apple logo before its title. The Sign in with X button includes a filled circle before its title. The Sign in with Y button includes a filled square before its title. The Sign in with Z button includes a filled triangle before its title. The screen on the right includes a heading that reads 'Sign in with', which appears above a row of four square buttons containing glyphs. The first square button contains the Apple logo. The second square button contains a filled circle. The third square button contains a filled square. The fourth square button contains a filled triangle. The circle, square, and triangle shapes represent a variety of logos.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7b12d1db6d56480ab4000122522945e1/custom-sign-in-screens%402x.png","line":168,"embedded":true},{"title":"Apple Design Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/","line":172},{"title":"A illustration of a black Apple logo within a white square, which is surrounded by a thick, shaded border. The white square represents the minimum amount of clear space between the Apple logo and other interface elements.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ed607e1cf28c1cd7497035516c9d06cf/siwa-black-logo-only%402x.png","line":174,"embedded":true},{"title":"A illustration of a white Apple logo within a black square, which is surrounded by a thick, light border. The black square represents the minimum amount of clear space between the Apple logo and other interface elements.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/76a7de0f49ff86242e7a08f53ec57bb5/siwa-white-logo-only%402x.png","line":176,"embedded":true},{"title":"Apple Design Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/","line":180},{"title":"Custom buttons with a logo and text","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sign-in-with-apple#Custom-buttons-with-a-logo-and-text","line":219},{"title":"An illustration of a Sign in with Apple button, with callouts that indicate a button height of 44 points and a font size of 19 points.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4d402bbb5bfa51a2e8ac34066866ff84/left-aligned-correct-proportions-2%402x.png","line":225,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a Sign in with Apple button, with callouts that indicate a button height of 56 points and a font size of 24 points.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b63e73cbcaf41594057e62ad49483d87/left-aligned-correct-proportions-1%402x.png","line":227,"embedded":true},{"title":"Custom logo-only buttons","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sign-in-with-apple#Custom-logo-only-buttons","line":243},{"title":"An illustration of a logo-only Sign in with Apple button. The button includes only the Apple logo, and the button has rounded corners.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/add0de82a670c705e32126fd9ee002e1/siwa-logo-masked-rounded-rect%402x.png","line":251,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a logo-only Sign in with Apple button. The button includes only the Apple logo, and the button has square corners.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b54adc4cec33d05188ec292f4b27e56f/siwa-logo-default%402x.png","line":253,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a logo-only Sign in with Apple button. The button includes only the Apple logo, and the button is circular.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/fe14635b234c465506a70990d162ff78/siwa-logo-masked-circle%402x.png","line":255,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sign-in-with-apple#Platform-considerations","line":259},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/de